							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"693149194510140595","clan_steamid":"103582791475483130","event_name":"Brand-New Demo Launches Today for Steam Next Fest, Gameplay Fully Revamped","event_type":28,"appid":4279510,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792400460,"rtime32_end_time":1792404060,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Now you can almost treat it as a brand-new game!\",null,null,null,null,null,\"\u73b0\u5728\u4f60\u51e0\u4e4e\u53ef\u4ee5\u628a\u5b83\u5f53\u4f5c\u4e00\u4e2a\u65b0\u6e38\u620f\u6765\u73a9\u4e86\uff01\",\"\u73fe\u5728\u4f60\u5e7e\u4e4e\u53ef\u4ee5\u628a\u5b83\u7576\u6210\u4e00\u6b3e\u65b0\u904a\u6232\u4f86\u73a9\u4e86\uff01\",\"\u0422\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440\u044c \u0435\u0451 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0438 \u043c\u043e\u0436\u043d\u043e \u0432\u043e\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0441\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0443\u044e \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0443!\",null,\"\u4eca\u3084\u307b\u307c\u65b0\u4f5c\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3068\u3057\u3066\u904a\u3079\u308b\u307b\u3069\u3067\u3059\uff01\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Agora voc\u00ea quase pode jog\u00e1-la como se fosse um jogo novo!\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"78f7a788b11475cb1558e5a3154aff71e48484b3.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"56f1d645ff75e1ccf8890cfbcb68d961ce9643a6.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"d20d89510b4adb388ac2354eb065805a27b34edd.png\",null,null,null,null,null,\"d20d89510b4adb388ac2354eb065805a27b34edd.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"693149194510140596","clanid":"45961722","posterid":"0","headline":"Brand-New Demo Launches Today for Steam Next Fest, Gameplay Fully Revamped","posttime":1792400495,"updatetime":1792400495,"body":"[p]Three months after the release of our first public demo, we are launching this revamped demo for Steam Next Fest. This version delivers an experience much closer to the full release. On one hand, we added key gameplay systems as scheduled in our development roadmap. On the other hand, gameplay has been adjusted based on feedback from the previous demo, alongside a wide range of technical optimizations.[\/p][p][\/p][previewyoutube=\"4XO4FEhOQV0;full\"][\/previewyoutube][p]Below are the detailed patch notes for this new demo:[\/p][h2]Game Flow Adjustments[\/h2][olist][*][p]Most Mortal Phase Content Removed Many players requested richer Mortal Phase gameplay for stronger immersion in the journey from mortal to cultivator. However, we realized the game\u2019s gameplay and technical framework are fully designed for post-flight content. Building a polished Mortal Phase would essentially require remaking half the game. The Mortal Phase in our prior demo was quite bare-bones and left a poor first impression on most players. We therefore decided to focus on the core experience and let players quickly advance to the Qi Refining stage.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Qi Refining Phase Flow Improvements Through several patches for the previous demo, many Qi Refining mechanics were refined to streamline gathering and crafting. This update brings further polish and adds more guidance for new players.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Massively Expanded Foundation Establishment Content The highlight of this update lies in the Foundation Establishment phase. Once players take flight to reach the continental lands beyond the islands, they will notice drastically increased map density. Countless ruins that previously offered little exploration value now hold story fragments, artifact materials and useful consumables, paired with abundant random events to keep discoveries constant.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Female Characters Available at Game Start Three female character options are available when starting a new game, each with unique portrait art. Gender affects NPC dialogue and same-sex dual cultivation is supported.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Spirit Root Draw at Game Start Early in the game, players will meet an immortal and draw several spirit roots from a random altar. Spirit roots heavily shape your character\u2019s early stat inclinations.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Story & NPCs[\/h2][olist][*][p]Ruin Storylines and the \"Remnant Memory\" System The worldbuilding of [i]Wufan Xianyu[\/i] unfolds through fragmented narratives scattered across ruins. Collected lore is stored in the Remnant Memory system for review anytime. Every planet hosts countless ruins, remnants of countless xianxia civilizations spanning millions of years. Some civilizations have perished, while others retreated into hidden planes via planar-folding formations. They left behind written records and even ancient scenes sealed by spiritual energy. Many ruins also hold spirits whose physical forms were destroyed when formations activated. These spirits are eternal and wander the ruins forever. Exploring these ruins reveals the history of ancient high-tier xianxia civilizations and gradually unveils the full game world.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Dao Companion Dialogue System The captured rogue cultivator feature introduced in the previous demo has been greatly expanded. Players may travel with Dao Companions, who recount tales of this world or their own past in different scenarios. Each Dao Companion has unique personality and backstory.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Dao Companion Support System Dao Companions are more than conversational partners; they provide combat support. Every Dao Companion has distinct support skills to restore HP, spiritual energy and grant various buffs. Dao Companions have their own spiritual energy gauge which can be refilled through dual cultivation.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Random Events[\/h2][olist][*][p]Aerial Entities Upon entering the world, you may encounter sect disciples patrolling the skies. Sent by cultivation sects across planets to investigate the Soul Devourer anomalies on Vermillion Bird Star. There are also elusive flying creatures whose true purpose will only be revealed late-game.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Merchant Ships \/ War Vessels & the Sage of Spirit Treasures Flying across the sky, you may encounter hostile war vessels, including interstellar slave ships, pirate ships or escort caravans. Merchant ships sell affordable urgent supplies. If you meet the Sage of Spirit Treasures, accept his quests for generous rewards.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Random Colossal Beasts Different biomes spawn colossal monsters such as tree demons, snow beasts and three-headed jiao. Slaying them yields massive experience. Later, random colossal beasts will appear on other planets, airspaces and outer space.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Overhauled Artifact System[\/h2][olist][*][p]Major & Minor Artifact Skills The biggest addition is the major\/minor artifact skill system, which deeply shapes player skill builds. In the old demo, automatic artifact attacks were powerful inside outposts but weak outside. Minor artifact skills function like standard ARPG abilities: unlimited uses with cooldowns. Major artifact skills consume spiritual energy and can wipe entire screens of small monsters, serving as your primary damage source for ruin exploration. Casting minor artifact skills regenerates spiritual energy. Typical combat loop: non-cooldown basic attacks from cultivation techniques\/spells + minor artifact skill finishing blows + charge spiritual energy to unleash major artifact skill for crowd clears.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Support Artifacts We added the Cold Light Mirror with defensive abilities and the Bodhi Lotus for continuous HP regeneration. These support artifacts are essential for both single-player and multiplayer. Especially against the Giant Spirit God, pills alone cannot sustain HP; the Bodhi Lotus heals your whole party far more effectively.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Artifact Shards While artifacts grow more powerful, crafting them becomes harder. Different artifacts require corresponding artifact shards scattered across ruins. To collect a full artifact set, players must thoroughly explore ruins everywhere.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Cultivation Techniques \/ Spells & Boss Fights[\/h2][olist][*][p]Cultivation Technique Stat Adjustments As mentioned before, combinations of cultivation techniques and spells offer near-endless variety but still count as basic attacks with capped damage. Players can still summon swarms of projectiles with technique combinations, yet higher projectile counts come with significant reductions in spell damage.[\/p][\/*][*][p]New Cultivation Techniques & Spells New Foundation Establishment spells are added, including one that launches flying swords. Combined with multi-projectile and new rapid-fire techniques, players can achieve effects reminiscent of Ten Thousand Swords Returning to One. Stats and effects of some techniques have been adjusted, for example the size amplification technique now creates much more noticeable enlargement.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Boss Battle The Giant Spirit God, previously only a static model, is the main boss of Foundation Establishment. Unlike the Wine Sword Immortal, this fight is not an outpost-defense Vampire Survivors-style encounter, but a traditional ARPG boss battle. Be sure to bring artifacts, especially Cold Light Mirror and Lotus Lamp. Bring a supportive Dao Companion and fully refill their spiritual energy gauge via dual cultivation before combat.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Multiplayer & Save Data[\/h2][olist][*][p]Bring Character Saves into Friends\u2019 Lobbies In older versions, saves could not be transferred to other players\u2019 lobbies, and progress earned there would not carry over locally. Most players could not fully enjoy multiplayer. Now you may bring your character save data into others\u2019 lobbies if the host enables progress import. The character save used in your friend\u2019s lobby can also be continued locally after your friend goes offline.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Alliance System in Multiplayer Players can create alliances in multiplayer. Others may apply to join or found their own alliances. Alliance leaders can assign different permission tiers to members, such as the right to demolish alliance buildings. If you fear disruption from strangers, you can disable progress import for visitors. You may also set passwords for storage chests.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Dedicated Servers Voxel destruction and high on-screen monster counts cause heavy frame drops when using a personal PC as host. Dedicated servers deliver a far smoother multiplayer experience. Several free dedicated servers are available for testing now, with limited player slots per instance \u2014 servers lock once full. Convenient server hosting tools will arrive later, allowing players to deploy private servers via third-party providers.[\/p][\/*][\/olist][h2]Other Optimizations & Changes[\/h2][olist][*][p]Resource spawn rules revised: resources of the same type cluster together, letting players gather sufficient materials easily within one zone.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Vermillion Bird Star is divided into five major regions: Starter Zone (Qi Refining Island), mid-planet snow\/forest zones and northern snow\/forest zones. Each zone hosts unique monsters and resources; monsters grow stronger further north.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Ruin monsters ignore regional rules, yet ruins further north hold stronger foes. Ruins have far higher monster density than regular zones.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Unlocking a spire reveals nearby outposts and chests. They remain visible even when using Divine Sense high in the sky far across the planet.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Items crafted at workbenches are automatically stored inside the workbench\u2019s built-in storage upon completion.[\/p][\/*][*][p]Art assets including trees and ground textures have been optimized.[\/p][\/*][*][p]The mini-game for realm breakthrough is removed; breakthrough now proceeds automatically. Success rate depends on materials. To avoid wasting materials on failure, stock enough materials and wait until success rate hits 100% before attempting breakthrough.[\/p][\/*][\/olist]","commentcount":7,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1809568072_1792401929_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"563671129707838260","event_gid":"693149194510140595","voteupcount":47,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"563671129707838260","rtime32_last_modified":1793178118,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792401929,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792336611,"votes_up":47,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"809100396253438056","gidfeature2":"563671129707838260"},{"gid":"687517794773764657","clan_steamid":"103582791475483130","event_name":"A brand-new Demo is coming soon for Steam Next Fest","event_type":28,"appid":4279510,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1790695740,"rtime32_end_time":1790699340,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Downloads for the current Demo will be shut down on October 2nd\",null,null,null,null,null,\"\u65e7\u7248\u672cDemo\u4e0b\u8f7d\u5c06\u4e8e10\u67082\u65e5\u5173\u95ed\",\"\u820a\u7248\u672c Demo \u4e0b\u8f09\u5c07\u65bc 10 \u6708 2 \u65e5\u95dc\u9589\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"7e69754b53159c22b4924d0adb56e3064cbbb1bd.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"f7dc3d5ca82063a45478014691360da15e86c308.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"687517794773764658","clanid":"45961722","posterid":"0","headline":"A brand-new Demo is coming soon for Steam Next Fest","posttime":1790695785,"updatetime":1790695785,"body":"[p]No Mortal Space is confirmed to participate in Steam Next Fest starting October 19th, where a brand-new Demo will be released. This new version adds plenty of gameplay content with major changes to the game progression, so it will [b]not be compatible with save files from the current Demo[\/b]. To prevent inconvenience for players during the transition between old and new versions, we will disable downloads for the old Demo starting October 2nd. After that, you may no longer launch the old Demo via Steam.[\/p][p][\/p][p]The Steam Next Fest build of [i]No Mortal Space[\/i] delivers a fresh gameplay experience. The following dev diary video showcases some of its new features:[\/p][p][\/p][previewyoutube=\"U_CQQ8Ps3ek;full\"][\/previewyoutube]","commentcount":4,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1607812438_1790696522_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"586187334843694273","event_gid":"687517794773764657","voteupcount":42,"votedowncount