								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Experience a true &quot;Power Fantasy&quot; progression. Start as a humble survivor gathering wood and stone, and evolve into a OverDeity who views civilizations as ants. With our fully destructible voxel world, your growth isn't just a stat—it’s the ability to physically reshape planets and shatter mountain ranges with a single talisman.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Interstellar Traversal</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The cosmos is your playground. Explore a multi-star system universe where every planet features unique biomes and civilizations. Your mobility scales with your Divine Rank:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Early Game: Trekking and short-range flight.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Mid Game: Infinite flight and atmospheric escape.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >End Game: Traversing black holes, and piloting massive Interstellar War-Barques to ferry loot across the galaxy.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Supreme Resource Gathering</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Forget tedious grinding. Once you reach Lesser Deity, your efficiency skyrockets.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Use Artifact to instantly clear-cut forests.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Deploy Earth-Shaking Talismans to detonate and collect entire mines in seconds.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Store it all in your Spatial Sack—the cosmos provides infinite resources for those strong enough to take them and you need huge amount of resource in the road to OverDeity.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.poster.avif?t=1792386780" width=1128 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.webm?t=1792386780" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/d360a51fc71f4e7391182bdc7a4af46a.mp4?t=1792386780" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >High-Octane Outpost Battle</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Claim &quot;Prime Resource&quot; outpost through intense, large-scale combat. Slay waves of enemies to absorb Spiritual Qi, overcharging your artifacts to reach exponential power levels. Experience the explosive, high-speed combat as you defend your territory and expand your Sect's reach.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.poster.avif?t=1792386780" width=1128 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.webm?t=1792386780" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/4a6ca0d7a2529d286ea0423fb99e347c.mp4?t=1792386780" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >Co-op Sect Building</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >The path to immortality is better with allies. Join friends to:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Co-pilot massive Sky War-Barques.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Combine unique Builds (BD) for Synergy Effects that decimate screen-clearing bosses.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Unleash massive Synergy Formation to wipe out entire armies in an instant.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.poster.avif?t=1792386780" width=1128 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.webm?t=1792386780" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/0af15b45cb8b7693c946dc3da11bf557.mp4?t=1792386780" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" >The Deity Style Automated Factory</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Build a sprawling magical industrial empire. Establish Automated Production Lines to refine elixir and forge artifacts.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Divine Automation: Capture and subdue wandering Gods and Demons to serve as your Sect Disciples.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Management: Assign these powerful entities to manage your production units, turning your sect into a self-sustaining powerhouse while you focus on reaching the next Divine Rank.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.poster.avif?t=1792386780" width=1128 height=480 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.webm?t=1792386780" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4279510/extras/b1d098302df6ac0f89622c1b1c58637b.mp4?t=1792386780" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p>						</div>
					</div>
